## 6. ROLE ASSIGNMENT POLICY

| Action | Who Can Do It | Method |
|---|---|---|
| Assign `admin` | `superAdmin` only | Admin SDK Cloud Function |
| Assign `vendor` | `admin`, `superAdmin` | Admin SDK Cloud Function |
| Assign `affiliate` | `admin`, `superAdmin` | Admin SDK Cloud Function |
| Assign `customer` | Automatic on registration | `onCreate` Cloud Function trigger |
| Revoke any role | `superAdmin` only | Admin SDK Cloud Function |
| Self-assign any role | **NEVER** | Blocked client-side + Firestore rules |

**Default on registration**: All new users receive `{ customer: true }` automatically via `onCreate` trigger.

```typescript
// ✅ Automatic customer role on signup
export const onUserCreate = onDocumentCreated('users/{uid}', async (event) => {
  await auth().setCustomUserClaims(event.params.uid, { customer: true });
});
```

